WEBVTT

00:00:02.039 --> 00:00:05.839
The beginning breeze

00:00:06.243 --> 00:00:10.111
Delivers this message

00:00:10.547 --> 00:00:19.114
"Because I have always believed in you"

00:00:20.257 --> 00:00:20.724
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:20.724 --> 00:00:28.832
The Story of Saiunkoku
We are standing in the land
we dreamed of back then

00:00:28.832 --> 00:00:29.127
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:29.366 --> 00:00:36.636
We feel weak at the knees a little,
gazing over the scenery

00:00:36.873 --> 00:00:41.003
But please don't look back

00:00:41.144 --> 00:00:45.171
Because you've decided to go forward

00:00:45.382 --> 00:00:49.478
I looked up into the sky to see
the rainbow with seven colors

00:00:49.753 --> 00:00:53.189
Can you see it too?

00:00:53.457 --> 00:00:57.359
The beginning breeze

00:00:57.761 --> 00:01:01.424
Delivers this message

00:01:01.865 --> 00:01:10.034
I will watch over you as
you go forth to chase your dreams

00:01:10.407 --> 00:01:18.610
The dancing winds in the blazing sun

00:01:19.049 --> 00:01:28.720
Fly forth strongly
with the wings of freedom

00:01:31.728 --> 00:01:33.821
The season arrives as a breeze,
carrying the scent of the...

00:01:33.897 --> 00:01:35.228
...summer's beginning gusts.

00:01:35.565 --> 00:01:40.025
Shurei's first ever departure from
Shi Province is only two days away.

00:01:43.940 --> 00:01:45.908
Koyu. Here you go.

00:01:46.109 --> 00:01:49.272
They're steamed buns with egg yolk
kneaded into the sweet bean paste.

00:01:49.613 --> 00:01:51.410
Have them while they're still warm.

00:01:51.681 --> 00:01:53.342
Sure. Thanks.

00:01:56.486 --> 00:01:59.853
It'll be a while before I can enjoy
your homemade steamed buns again.

00:02:00.424 --> 00:02:02.324
Shall I teach you how to
make them?

00:02:04.227 --> 00:02:05.159
By the way...

00:02:05.495 --> 00:02:07.395
...there's something
I need to talk to you about.

00:02:10.634 --> 00:02:15.594
The Wise Man Does Not Court Danger

00:02:17.240 --> 00:02:20.607
It's about what happened one year
ago, when you were taken hostage.

00:02:23.246 --> 00:02:27.239
That time I was poisoned, held captive
at the Enlightened Ones' Cave...

00:02:27.551 --> 00:02:31.078
...and then rescued by His Majesty.
That's all I remember about it.

00:02:31.855 --> 00:02:35.188
At the time, no one would tell
me the truth about the matter.

00:02:36.159 --> 00:02:39.617
So I assumed the subject was
taboo and never asked about it.

00:02:41.932 --> 00:02:45.265
You're an official. You're no longer
someone who must be protected.

00:02:45.802 --> 00:02:48.566
So I will tell you, if you wish.

00:02:52.642 --> 00:02:57.602
That incident was all part of a plot
by the late Advisor Sa, Enjun Sa.

00:02:59.783 --> 00:03:01.717
He wanted to rise
above Advisor Sho.

00:03:01.785 --> 00:03:04.811
To realize that ambition, he
attempted to eliminate His Majesty...

00:03:05.422 --> 00:03:07.390
...and put in a different king.

00:03:07.824 --> 00:03:10.190
We were able to find out
from an unexpected source.

00:03:11.661 --> 00:03:12.992
Korin.

00:03:13.597 --> 00:03:16.430
Korin loved Enjun Sa with
all her heart.

00:03:17.767 --> 00:03:20.895
His Majesty changed after you
entered the royal residence...

00:03:21.004 --> 00:03:24.405
...so quite likely Advisor Sa
found your presence bothersome.

00:03:25.609 --> 00:03:30.569
That's why Korin, wanting to help,
and despite not having been so ordered...

00:03:32.115 --> 00:03:34.606
...poisoned you.

00:03:35.285 --> 00:03:37.116
Were you aware of it?

00:03:37.320 --> 00:03:38.651
No.

00:03:38.722 --> 00:03:42.351
But Korin was probably hesitating. As a
result, her actions were quite obvious.

00:03:45.328 --> 00:03:50.698
I was unaware of it.
I never once suspected Korin.

00:03:51.301 --> 00:03:53.235
Korin returned to
Sa Province after that...

00:03:53.336 --> 00:03:55.634
...and now, Ensei has brought
her back here.

00:03:55.906 --> 00:03:57.897
Apparently, she wants to
apologize to you personally.

00:03:59.009 --> 00:04:01.409
Decide for yourself whether
or not you will see her.

00:04:03.480 --> 00:04:04.947
Okay.

00:04:10.120 --> 00:04:12.088
Is something bothering you, Shurei?

00:04:12.155 --> 00:04:16.251
Ah, no. I was just wondering what
sort of place Sa Province is.

00:04:16.993 --> 00:04:19.086
Oh. Right.

00:04:20.230 --> 00:04:24.326
I've heard that the Sa Clan has tried
to seize power in Sa Province

00:04:24.534 --> 00:04:26.502
Mr. Ensei, the previous
governor, says...

00:04:26.636 --> 00:04:29.104
...they sent in a number of
assassins to try and kill him.

00:04:29.172 --> 00:04:31.697
So we may not survive this
even if we have multiple lives.

00:04:32.042 --> 00:04:34.374
Y-You say that so casually, Eigetsu.

00:04:34.778 --> 00:04:37.440
But even so, someone has to go.
And that just happens to be us.

00:04:37.547 --> 00:04:40.107
It's as simple as that.

00:04:41.685 --> 00:04:43.653
Let's do our best together, Shurei.

00:04:44.821 --> 00:04:47.051
You're very strong, Eigetsu.

00:04:51.728 --> 00:04:53.195
Ryuren!

00:04:53.530 --> 00:04:56.761
What I just played is to celebrate
my reunion with my kindred spirits.

00:04:57.000 --> 00:05:00.060
Hey! Why did you skip out
on the Initiation Ceremony?!

00:05:00.637 --> 00:05:02.935
The wind invited me to
go out on a journey.

00:05:03.073 --> 00:05:05.200
A journey?!
Just what were you thinking?!

00:05:05.342 --> 00:05:10.177
N-Now, Shurei. I'm sure Ryuren
has his reasons for it. Probably.

00:05:10.347 --> 00:05:11.678
No way!

00:05:11.748 --> 00:05:14.342
But never mind that. Let's go buy
groceries for tonight's dinner.

00:05:14.818 --> 00:05:16.308
Ryuren, will you join us?

00:05:16.519 --> 00:05:18.714
I'd like some sweetly-sour pork.

00:05:18.922 --> 00:05:20.947
What are you doing,
putting in an order?!

00:05:21.024 --> 00:05:23.618
Ah! I wanna eat some too!
Sweet and sour pork!

00:05:29.099 --> 00:05:31.067
This sweetly sour scent...!

00:05:32.068 --> 00:05:34.127
Honestly! That peacock-man!

00:05:35.171 --> 00:05:35.603
Hi!

00:05:35.672 --> 00:05:37.139
Oh, Mr. Ensei.

00:05:37.641 --> 00:05:40.303
Princess. I hate to bother you seeing
that you're busy, but I brought...

00:05:40.377 --> 00:05:42.902
...the traveling companion
that I told you about before.

00:05:42.979 --> 00:05:44.947
Would you mind meeting her?

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:48.144
I'll meet her.

00:05:54.424 --> 00:05:56.153
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:06:01.598 --> 00:06:03.566
Ah, um, it's been a long time.

00:06:04.267 --> 00:06:06.235
Yes. It's been a while, hasn't it, Korin?

00:06:06.736 --> 00:06:10.035
Ah! I can't have the Consort
make tea for me! I will...!

00:06:11.174 --> 00:06:12.539
Ouch! That's hot!

00:06:12.609 --> 00:06:14.008
I'm so sorry, Ensei!

00:06:14.177 --> 00:06:16.145
Are you all right?

00:06:16.713 --> 00:06:18.806
I'm all right. I'll go chill it for a bit.

00:06:22.485 --> 00:06:27.923
I remember I made a similar blunder
the first time I met you, Consort.

00:06:28.425 --> 00:06:29.722
You can call me Shurei.

00:06:29.793 --> 00:06:31.658
Ah, yes. I beg your pardon.

00:06:34.564 --> 00:06:37.089
Consort... I mean, Shurei...

00:06:37.367 --> 00:06:39.835
...I understand that you're to
become Governor of Sa Province.

00:06:40.403 --> 00:06:41.870
Yes.

00:06:43.506 --> 00:06:45.269
How are conditions in Sa Province?

00:06:45.375 --> 00:06:47.138
Actually, things are quite unsettled.

00:06:48.078 --> 00:06:50.945
One of the reasons I came to Shi
Province was to bring some petitions.

00:06:51.681 --> 00:06:52.875
Petitions?

00:06:52.949 --> 00:06:57.852
I was a maid-in-waiting
to Eiki, Enjun Sa's wife.

00:06:58.555 --> 00:07:04.118
But she's under house arrest and her
granddaughter Shunki is in hiding.

00:07:06.029 --> 00:07:08.088
That's quite a serious situation.

00:07:08.398 --> 00:07:11.299
Shurei, are you really
going to Sa Province?

00:07:12.368 --> 00:07:13.494
Yes.

00:07:13.570 --> 00:07:17.199
That's... that's too much!
Did His Majesty order this?

00:07:17.807 --> 00:07:20.970
Is he getting back at you for
leaving the royal residence?

00:07:21.377 --> 00:07:22.674
You're mistaken.

00:07:22.746 --> 00:07:28.048
He entrusted me and the other new
governor, Eigetsu, with his hope.

00:07:28.685 --> 00:07:30.209
But why deliberately send you...

00:07:30.286 --> 00:07:31.776
...somewhere that he
knows is dangerous?

00:07:32.455 --> 00:07:36.755
I'm sure he believes that this is the
best move. But never mind that, Korin.

00:07:37.260 --> 00:07:39.728
Wasn't there something else
you wanted to talk to me about?

00:07:40.430 --> 00:07:42.591
Well, um... I was...

00:07:43.633 --> 00:07:47.763
...hoping you would allow me to
accompany you to Sa Province.

00:07:48.772 --> 00:07:51.036
I'm sure there will be
many dangers along the way.

00:07:51.608 --> 00:07:55.874
So I wish to protect you,
even if it means my life.

00:07:57.247 --> 00:07:59.010
Would it not be all right?

00:07:59.549 --> 00:08:03.076
- I wouldn't say no, but...!
- Then please think it over!

00:08:03.353 --> 00:08:06.845
Also, there are many other things
I want to talk to you about.

00:08:07.457 --> 00:08:09.288
But I'll leave that for
some other time.

00:08:09.425 --> 00:08:10.187
All right.

00:08:13.429 --> 00:08:15.920
In that case, I'll take my leave for today.

00:08:21.404 --> 00:08:22.871
Korin.

00:08:23.540 --> 00:08:25.269
Did you say everything
you needed to?

00:08:25.341 --> 00:08:27.400
I couldn't bring myself
to tell her.

00:08:27.544 --> 00:08:28.568
I see.

00:08:29.679 --> 00:08:33.206
Come to think of it, this is
where I first met Princess.

00:08:34.184 --> 00:08:37.051
I had collapsed by the roadside
and she took me in and fed me...

00:08:37.420 --> 00:08:39.650
...even though she had no
idea who the hell I was.

00:08:39.722 --> 00:08:41.053
That's very much like her.

00:08:41.457 --> 00:08:43.652
Princess is very open-minded.

00:08:44.627 --> 00:08:47.653
Be frank with her, and I'm
sure she'll understand.

00:08:49.732 --> 00:08:51.165
Yes.

00:08:56.639 --> 00:08:58.903
I'm so glad you're all right, Ryuren.

00:08:59.475 --> 00:09:00.442
You passed in second place...

00:09:00.510 --> 00:09:02.137
...yet you didn't come to the
Initiation Ceremony...

00:09:02.212 --> 00:09:04.680
...so I was concerned that something
might have happened to you.

00:09:04.948 --> 00:09:07.746
Although Shurei said there was
absolutely nothing to worry about.

00:09:09.152 --> 00:09:10.619
Kindred spirit.

00:09:12.355 --> 00:09:13.515
What?

00:09:13.590 --> 00:09:16.889
As always, your cooking
is so very delicious!

00:09:17.026 --> 00:09:18.550
I'm glad to hear it.

00:09:18.628 --> 00:09:20.186
So, I have a proposal for you.

00:09:20.296 --> 00:09:20.955
What is it?

00:09:21.030 --> 00:09:23.498
Won't you become my
personal chef, after all?

00:09:24.100 --> 00:09:25.624
Not a chance!

00:09:26.302 --> 00:09:29.135
A-Ah, but it really was something
during the exams, wasn't it?

00:09:29.706 --> 00:09:32.174
You created many legends,
didn't you, Ryuren?

00:09:32.876 --> 00:09:34.810
You mean, like the
Cursed 13th Building?

00:09:35.345 --> 00:09:36.607
Huh? Well...!

00:09:36.679 --> 00:09:40.240
Wow. The preparatory dorm
I stayed in is cursed?

00:09:40.617 --> 00:09:44.713
Wrong! It came to be called that
because you were staying there!

00:09:45.021 --> 00:09:46.989
One after another,
the other examinees...

00:09:47.056 --> 00:09:48.990
...became mentally disturbed,
thanks to your flute!

00:09:49.058 --> 00:09:50.320
And as a result of taking part in...

00:09:50.393 --> 00:09:51.951
incomprehensible conversations
with you...

00:09:52.028 --> 00:09:54.553
...seven officials who administer the
exams submitted their resignation!

00:09:54.631 --> 00:09:57.794
And yet, he himself passed as Bogen.

00:09:58.902 --> 00:10:00.893
General Ran was
bemoaning the fact...

00:10:00.970 --> 00:10:02.494
...that he should've kept you locked
up at his residence...

00:10:02.572 --> 00:10:04.267
...until just before the exams.

00:10:04.707 --> 00:10:08.143
Silly Brother Number Four's residence
is pointlessly large and glittery.

00:10:08.544 --> 00:10:10.444
It doesn't suit my sense
of aesthetics whatsoever.

00:10:10.513 --> 00:10:12.037
On the other hand, this residence...

00:10:12.115 --> 00:10:14.413
...given the obvious signs
of vain efforts of repair,

00:10:14.851 --> 00:10:16.819
the nice degree of sprouting weeds,

00:10:16.953 --> 00:10:19.979
and the self-sufficient spirit
apparent in the backyard garden...!

00:10:21.524 --> 00:10:23.321
Everything gets a passing grade.

00:10:23.393 --> 00:10:24.985
I never asked for your opinion!

00:10:25.094 --> 00:10:26.061
Kindred spirit number two.

00:10:27.563 --> 00:10:28.689
I wish you'd provide
dinner conversation...

00:10:28.765 --> 00:10:30.824
...that is more appropriate
and enjoyable.

00:10:31.301 --> 00:10:33.531
Enjoyable? Ah, let's see...!

00:10:34.070 --> 00:10:35.037
Speaking of cursed...

00:10:35.104 --> 00:10:37.800
...I've heard of a ghost appearing at the
Ministry of the Enlightened Ones' Cave.

00:10:38.308 --> 00:10:39.104
A ghost?

00:10:39.175 --> 00:10:40.233
While it's still not appropriate
dinner conversation...

00:10:40.310 --> 00:10:41.641
...I'm interested to hear more.

00:10:41.945 --> 00:10:44.413
Apparently, a number
of people have seen it.

00:10:44.948 --> 00:10:46.882
I would very much like to hunt it.

00:10:47.383 --> 00:10:48.907
Let's do so tonight!

00:10:48.985 --> 00:10:53.217
Let us assemble after dark tonight,
kindred spirits number one and two.

00:10:54.524 --> 00:10:56.492
In front of the Ministry!

00:10:57.126 --> 00:10:59.617
- Well then, I'll see you later tonight.
- H-Hey!

00:11:06.002 --> 00:11:08.470
We're hunting ghosts before
leaving for our post?

00:11:12.108 --> 00:11:17.068
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:11:19.015 --> 00:11:22.678
Honestly! Nothing good
comes from dealing with him.

00:11:23.086 --> 00:11:25.611
But Shurei, you seem to
be in better spirits now.

00:11:27.090 --> 00:11:29.149
You appeared to be a bit down.

00:11:29.726 --> 00:11:30.750
Are you saying that peacock-man...

00:11:30.827 --> 00:11:35.093
...said we should hunt ghosts just
to cheer me up?

00:11:35.798 --> 00:11:37.595
It's possible.

00:11:37.667 --> 00:11:39.464
Who's there?!

00:11:41.838 --> 00:11:43.897
Official Hong and Official To.

00:11:45.274 --> 00:11:47.469
What are you doing at this
time of night?

00:11:47.944 --> 00:11:49.468
Well, um, you see...!

00:11:50.046 --> 00:11:51.980
I asked them to come.

00:11:52.315 --> 00:11:53.282
I have something to
discuss with them...

00:11:53.349 --> 00:11:55.340
...in private regarding
their assignment.

00:11:57.754 --> 00:11:58.277
Yes.

00:11:58.621 --> 00:12:00.054
Excuse us. Good night.

00:12:04.861 --> 00:12:06.556
What is it, this time of night?

00:12:06.662 --> 00:12:07.720
Huh? Well...!

00:12:08.097 --> 00:12:08.791
A tryst?

00:12:08.865 --> 00:12:09.991
No way!

00:12:10.066 --> 00:12:12.125
You don't have to be
so quick to deny it.

00:12:12.368 --> 00:12:14.859
What about you? What are you
doing in a place like this?

00:12:14.937 --> 00:12:19.465
Ah, well, I couldn't sleep, so I
was taking a walk. And you two?

00:12:20.276 --> 00:12:22.540
Oh, right. Have you seen Ryuren?

00:12:22.645 --> 00:12:23.805
You mean Ryuren Ran?

00:12:24.013 --> 00:12:25.480
No, I understand his whereabouts...

00:12:25.548 --> 00:12:27.539
...have been unknown ever since
he missed the Initiation Ceremony.

00:12:27.784 --> 00:12:30.048
He came to my home today
and ate sweet and sour pork.

00:12:30.353 --> 00:12:31.445
What?

00:12:31.521 --> 00:12:34.922
And Ryuren said he wants
to hunt a ghost, so...!

00:12:34.991 --> 00:12:36.015
A ghost?

00:12:36.092 --> 00:12:39.550
In any case, we're supposed to meet
Ryuren in front of the Ministry.

00:12:39.629 --> 00:12:42.496
And we need to meet up with him
before he causes a commotion.

00:12:47.270 --> 00:12:50.171
WAIT!! Don't play that flute!

00:12:50.573 --> 00:12:53.133
You're pretty late getting here,
kindred spirits number one and two.

00:12:53.443 --> 00:12:57.174
How did you manage to get into the
palace without getting into trouble?

00:12:57.980 --> 00:12:59.607
When I showed them the
Ran Clan travel pass...

00:12:59.715 --> 00:13:02.183
...the guards let me
through without incident.

00:13:02.385 --> 00:13:05.650
We haven't seen one another
since the exams, Ryuren Ran.

00:13:06.489 --> 00:13:08.548
I've passed your message
on to my elder brothers.

00:13:08.658 --> 00:13:09.784
What's he talking about?

00:13:09.859 --> 00:13:12.327
Two days after the exams,
I went to see him.

00:13:12.728 --> 00:13:16.528
I asked him to convey that fact to his
brothers, the heads of the Ran clan.

00:13:17.467 --> 00:13:20.095
The king himself went to
see an individual examinee?

00:13:20.570 --> 00:13:22.765
I've heard that while they
have a great deal of power...

00:13:22.872 --> 00:13:25.466
...the Ran Clan doesn't
involve itself with politics.

00:13:25.708 --> 00:13:28.677
Perhaps he was giving his
regards to the Ran Clan?

00:13:28.744 --> 00:13:32.976
While there was that, his paper was
impressive, so I wanted to meet him.

00:13:34.150 --> 00:13:36.641
That aside, what are you
gonna do about hunting ghosts?

00:13:36.752 --> 00:13:38.913
Naturally, we'll exorcise
it upon finding it.

00:13:38.988 --> 00:13:39.886
How?

00:13:41.858 --> 00:13:43.985
Hey! I said stop playing that flute!

00:13:45.228 --> 00:13:47.560
That ghost isn't appearing, is it?

00:13:47.930 --> 00:13:50.899
Rumor has it that it appears around
the Enlightened Ones' Cave...

00:13:51.167 --> 00:13:53.135
...but it's only a rumor just the same.

00:13:54.937 --> 00:13:57.701
They say that the wise man
does not court danger.

00:13:57.773 --> 00:14:00.241
How about giving up hunting
ghosts and coming to my quarters?

00:14:00.643 --> 00:14:02.201
I'll have a late snack prepared.

00:14:02.278 --> 00:14:03.006
Good idea.

00:14:03.079 --> 00:14:05.843
Thank you for offering. That's all
right with you, isn't it, Ryuren?

00:14:06.415 --> 00:14:08.883
Well then, we shall tell
ghost stories instead.

00:14:21.564 --> 00:14:25.500
I've heard that a ghost appears at the
Ministry of the Enlightened Ones' Cave.

00:14:25.768 --> 00:14:27.531
The Ministry of the
Enlightened Ones' Cave.

00:14:27.603 --> 00:14:30.902
I often told the story to the
kids at the temple school...

00:14:31.340 --> 00:14:33.808
...about there being eight enlightened
ones in our country long ago.

00:14:33.876 --> 00:14:35.537
Eight Colored
Enlightened Ones, right?

00:14:35.611 --> 00:14:36.202
Yes.

00:14:36.279 --> 00:14:39.112
Children love those sorts
of mysterious stories.

00:14:39.916 --> 00:14:45.786
Blue, purple, red, green,
yellow, white, black, and brown.

00:14:46.556 --> 00:14:47.989
As a child, I often played...

00:14:48.057 --> 00:14:50.184
...pretending that I was one of the
Eight Colored Enlightened Ones.

00:14:50.259 --> 00:14:51.283
Really?

00:14:51.360 --> 00:14:53.692
They say that even now, each
of the eight enlightened ones...

00:14:53.763 --> 00:14:55.628
...is living in someone else's body.

00:14:55.798 --> 00:14:57.732
Someone else's body?

00:14:57.800 --> 00:15:00.268
It would be nice if the enlightened
ones were doing that even now...

00:15:00.336 --> 00:15:02.270
...and helping this country, wouldn't it?

00:15:02.338 --> 00:15:03.032
It would?

00:15:03.272 --> 00:15:04.136
Yes.

00:15:04.473 --> 00:15:07.237
As a child, I was quite sickly.

00:15:07.777 --> 00:15:10.610
But after mom died,
I became much better.

00:15:11.414 --> 00:15:13.882
So, from time to time, I
wonder about the possibility...

00:15:13.950 --> 00:15:16.748
...that mother's life
might have entered me.

00:15:17.553 --> 00:15:20.181
And that she's been helping me.

00:15:21.023 --> 00:15:24.857
So even now, your mother
is alive inside you.

00:15:25.561 --> 00:15:27.529
It gives me added energy to think so.

00:15:29.232 --> 00:15:33.430
But there's one inside you too, right,
Eigetsu? A helpful enlightened one.

00:15:34.403 --> 00:15:37.566
You being so kind natured, maybe
Yogetsu was born to help you.

00:15:38.140 --> 00:15:40.005
You mean inside kindred
spirit number two there's...

00:15:40.076 --> 00:15:41.941
...a kindred spirit number 2.5?

00:15:42.211 --> 00:15:44.008
He comes out when
he drinks alcohol.

00:15:44.814 --> 00:15:46.782
Please don't talk about that!

00:15:48.985 --> 00:15:49.952
Well, while traveling...

00:15:50.019 --> 00:15:52.681
...I do often run into mysterious
or frightening experiences.

00:15:53.456 --> 00:15:56.220
For instance, this happened when
I took a room at a small inn.

00:15:57.193 --> 00:16:00.253
I was sleeping at night when I
suddenly felt like I was...

00:16:00.329 --> 00:16:02.354
...being watched and woke up.

00:16:02.598 --> 00:16:03.895
I opened my eyes.

00:16:05.067 --> 00:16:07.627
There... I saw many
eyes floating on the ceiling.

00:16:08.571 --> 00:16:10.664
I doubt I'm gonna
be able to sleep tonight.

00:16:11.540 --> 00:16:12.905
On another night...

00:16:13.042 --> 00:16:14.009
...for some unknown reason...

00:16:14.076 --> 00:16:15.634
...there was a girl sitting in the
corner of my room.

00:16:15.711 --> 00:16:19.044
And that girl's face... it was the
most frightening thing in the world.

00:16:19.215 --> 00:16:23.015
Stop it! I'm afraid of the dark as it is.

00:16:23.119 --> 00:16:26.145
Ah, on that note, seeing how
late it is, we should be going.

00:16:26.355 --> 00:16:29.586
- Y-You're right.
- Not yet! I still have many stories to tell!

00:16:29.659 --> 00:16:31.149
You don't need to tell any more.

00:16:31.227 --> 00:16:33.252
You're leaving me
behind and going home?!

00:16:34.697 --> 00:16:36.665
I wonder if His Majesty
will be all right.

00:16:36.766 --> 00:16:38.927
Even so, we can't just stay overnight.

00:16:39.335 --> 00:16:42.327
Before going, I'll play a melody
to disperse any evil spirits.

00:16:42.405 --> 00:16:43.463
W-Wait!

00:16:48.377 --> 00:16:50.470
Please stop playing that flute.

00:16:51.113 --> 00:16:52.080
Ah, I'm sorry.

00:16:53.015 --> 00:16:55.483
You haven't changed one bit,
have you, Ryuren Ran?

00:16:59.822 --> 00:17:01.585
So, you must be Eigetsu To.

00:17:03.592 --> 00:17:04.559
Who would've imagined...

00:17:04.627 --> 00:17:07.619
...you'd be chosen
to serve as Sa Province's governor.

00:17:09.031 --> 00:17:10.999
Um, I beg your pardon, but you are...?

00:17:11.567 --> 00:17:13.296
Those who love the country...

00:17:13.369 --> 00:17:16.031
...will undoubtedly be protected by
the Eight Colored Enlightened Ones.

00:17:29.418 --> 00:17:30.749
I-It appeared.

00:17:30.986 --> 00:17:31.714
Yeah.

00:17:32.355 --> 00:17:34.323
Kindred spirits number one and two.

00:17:35.624 --> 00:17:37.114
We'll meet again.

00:17:37.993 --> 00:17:39.460
You're not gonna exorcise it?!

00:17:39.729 --> 00:17:41.720
The wise man does not court danger.

00:17:56.812 --> 00:17:59.679
While I thought to disperse evil
spirits by playing my flute...

00:17:59.815 --> 00:18:01.840
...when I play, evil spirits appear.

00:18:04.587 --> 00:18:06.555
I have a favor to ask you.

00:18:06.689 --> 00:18:08.247
For the sake of the new
co-governors...

00:18:08.324 --> 00:18:11.691
...I'd like you to take these as a gift
and go visit them at some point.

00:18:12.161 --> 00:18:14.356
I believe you're in the
best position to do so.

00:18:14.864 --> 00:18:19.699
While you won't do anything for me,
it's a different matter if it's for them.

00:18:19.869 --> 00:18:21.894
If you ever feel up to it,
I'd appreciate it...

00:18:21.971 --> 00:18:23.529
...if you would write to me
regarding the situation...

00:18:23.606 --> 00:18:24.595
...at the end of your wanderings.

00:18:24.707 --> 00:18:27.175
Without even telling my
foolish elder brother?

00:18:27.777 --> 00:18:29.745
Elder brother Shu lacks
your trust, I see.

00:18:30.146 --> 00:18:31.943
I trust in him with all my heart.

00:18:32.014 --> 00:18:36.576
However, unlike you, in spirit, Shuei
can't escape the yoke of the Ran Clan.

00:18:36.852 --> 00:18:40.379
I want someone who isn't tied to
the wishes of the seven clans.

00:18:41.557 --> 00:18:43.525
Your intentions, King,
are transparent...

00:18:43.592 --> 00:18:46.060
...to my three eldest brothers
who are the Ran Clan leaders.

00:18:46.328 --> 00:18:47.192
That doesn't matter.

00:18:47.630 --> 00:18:50.030
It is said that after you
took the name Ryuren Ran...

00:18:50.166 --> 00:18:53.727
...your three elder brothers divided the
clan leadership amongst themselves.

00:18:54.203 --> 00:18:55.864
No doubt, they didn't want you...

00:18:56.071 --> 00:18:58.301
...to have to take the clan leadership
before you had the chance...

00:18:58.374 --> 00:19:00.365
...to see the world or to become
involved with other people.

00:19:00.576 --> 00:19:02.840
What's important is the fact
that I ask this of you...

00:19:02.912 --> 00:19:05.540
...for whom the Ran Clan
cares so much.

00:19:08.617 --> 00:19:12.109
For visiting friends,
this gift alone lacks refinement.

00:19:12.688 --> 00:19:14.656
I imagine the season will be
summer or early autumn...

00:19:14.723 --> 00:19:16.156
...so I'll add some pears.

00:19:17.159 --> 00:19:19.627
The Courts can manage
even without the Ran Clan.

00:19:19.795 --> 00:19:21.729
Certainly the Ran Clan is
very important.

00:19:21.797 --> 00:19:25.289
However, it's not at all a problem to
have the sleeping dragons stay asleep.

00:19:25.801 --> 00:19:29.498
However, should the dragons awaken
and once again lend us their power...

00:19:30.105 --> 00:19:32.335
...I would be more than
happy to take that hand.

00:19:32.408 --> 00:19:34.273
I accept.

00:19:35.110 --> 00:19:38.568
Ryuren Ran, do you really have no
intention of becoming an official?

00:19:39.248 --> 00:19:40.112
I don't.

00:19:40.416 --> 00:19:42.179
What about becoming
leader of the Ran Clan?

00:19:42.251 --> 00:19:43.218
In simple terms...

00:19:44.353 --> 00:19:48.119
...I believe that I
mustn't wish for that sort of thing.

00:20:03.906 --> 00:20:06.272
You didn't go home, big brother?

00:20:07.276 --> 00:20:09.244
I thought you'd likely come back.

00:20:09.645 --> 00:20:13.206
But stop calling me big brother.
Or else I'll start being humble to you.

00:20:13.682 --> 00:20:15.650
Ah, right. I'll stop. I'll stop.

00:20:17.486 --> 00:20:21.889
What sort of young man is Ryuren
Ran? Is he similar to General Ran?

00:20:23.058 --> 00:20:25.583
He is. But he's much
deeper than Shuei.

00:20:26.695 --> 00:20:29.789
While he's said to be eccentric,
he seemed normal to me.

00:20:30.866 --> 00:20:34.427
But I sense that even
that isn't the true him.

00:20:35.170 --> 00:20:39.231
Ryuren Ran, truly a young lord
reflective of the very clan itself.

00:20:43.178 --> 00:20:44.736
Now then, I'll be going.

00:20:44.880 --> 00:20:45.642
Big brother.

00:20:46.815 --> 00:20:48.783
Take care of Shurei.

00:20:54.456 --> 00:20:58.586
Let me walk by your side a little longer.
I won't see you for a while.

00:21:06.402 --> 00:21:08.666
Welcome home.
You were awfully late.

00:21:08.971 --> 00:21:11.496
You left a note saying only that
you were going to the palace.

00:21:11.574 --> 00:21:13.269
I was so worried I couldn't sleep.

00:21:13.342 --> 00:21:14.900
I'm sorry, Father.

00:21:15.210 --> 00:21:17.178
I'm sorry to have caused
such concern.

00:21:17.479 --> 00:21:20.880
Also, a guest came late at night
and stayed up and waited with me.

00:21:21.684 --> 00:21:22.514
Korin?

00:21:22.585 --> 00:21:23.643
No.

00:21:26.522 --> 00:21:30.925
This is Kuro. My younger brother.
In other words, your uncle.

00:21:31.060 --> 00:21:32.687
While I'm somewhat late in doing so...

00:21:32.761 --> 00:21:34.729
...I give you my congratulations
on your passing...

00:21:34.797 --> 00:21:35.627
...as Tanka on the National Exams.

00:21:36.398 --> 00:21:37.592
Thank you very much!

00:21:37.666 --> 00:21:40.328
Elder brother Sho would not
permit us, of the main house...

00:21:40.402 --> 00:21:43.235
...to have any involvement with
this household until now.

00:21:43.339 --> 00:21:45.330
However, things are different now.

00:21:45.407 --> 00:21:46.874
You'll need the help of the
main house...

00:21:46.942 --> 00:21:49.274
...to protect you from the various
plots that will fall upon you.

00:21:49.378 --> 00:21:51.369
As proxy clan leader,
I share responsibility...

00:21:51.580 --> 00:21:53.275
...with the clan leader to protect you.

00:21:53.849 --> 00:21:56.818
The Hong Clan shall protect the path
you take with all its strength.

00:22:05.728 --> 00:22:09.528
I doubt anyone suspects
that you have the real ring.

00:22:11.367 --> 00:22:14.336
About the fake ring that came into
Senior Secretary Sai's possession.

00:22:14.470 --> 00:22:17.337
I imagine you had that made and
arranged for it to end up in his hands.

00:22:17.439 --> 00:22:19.703
In order to make his
corrupt activities known.

00:22:19.775 --> 00:22:21.436
Well, yeah.

00:22:21.543 --> 00:22:24.444
Honestly. Everything is
happening exactly as you plan.

00:22:32.988 --> 00:22:34.956
It's been a while, hasn't it, So?

00:22:35.824 --> 00:22:38.418
I see that as a ghost, you
become much younger, Enjun.

00:22:38.794 --> 00:22:43.026
Using this ring was the
easiest way to retain his soul.

00:22:43.499 --> 00:22:47.128
After the country is stabilized, the
Sa Clan will only become a problem.

00:22:48.003 --> 00:22:51.302
So I created the perfect
opportunity, and what did you do?

00:22:51.540 --> 00:22:55.271
Are you saying that you plotted
to kill His Majesty and Shurei...

00:22:55.477 --> 00:22:58.446
...in order to create an opportunity to
bring about the downfall of the Sa Clan?

00:23:00.249 --> 00:23:05.778
But no doubt the new co-governors will
save Sa Province by different means.

00:23:08.357 --> 00:23:11.292
Next will be Sa Province.

00:23:17.299 --> 00:23:19.426
Tomorrow we leave for Sa Province.

00:23:20.903 --> 00:23:23.064
Whatever happens,
I have to do my best!

00:23:30.612 --> 00:23:35.709
You've always led a very carefree life
and right now

00:23:35.851 --> 00:23:42.415
Amidst this rain
what sort of dreams are you chasing?

00:23:42.524 --> 00:23:47.587
And while you are fighting
loneliness somewhere

00:23:47.696 --> 00:23:52.690
You must be holding back
the tears too

00:23:53.769 --> 00:23:58.229
You say you'll be fine alone

00:23:59.775 --> 00:24:04.906
You are just like me

00:24:05.647 --> 00:24:10.175
Even if we have to take
the longer way around

00:24:10.252 --> 00:24:16.157
We somehow still prefer this route

00:24:17.126 --> 00:24:22.928
Whenever I feel happy or glad

00:24:23.031 --> 00:24:27.900
I will always think of you

00:24:29.037 --> 00:24:41.711
I believe that the colorful seasons will
deliver this feeling of mine to you

00:24:45.154 --> 00:24:46.221
Next Episode

00:24:46.221 --> 00:24:48.323
Next Episode
The time has finally come to leave
for Sa Province as its governor.

